    {
      "id": "uUDgp0JPWin4TnZLQPwU3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1303.4306221627426,
      "y": 103670.20692597446,
      "width": 1287,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bvk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 258455695,
      "version": 673,
      "versionNonce": 1918621102,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781398945275,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here we represent our workflow as a graph, due to that its name as LangGraph. Here we represent each\ntask as a node.\nHiring request is a node\ncreate jd\nApprove Jd\n..\n\n\nall these are node, we draw edge in between them, with the help of these edges, and in these edge we can appy looping\nbranching etc that make code more maintainable, this control executes. these\nedges decide control flow. Since we are representing whole workflow as a graph, and graph is a non linear \ndata structure. Here we can represent any workflow no matter howmuch complex.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here we represent our workflow as a graph, due to that its name as LangGraph. Here we represent each\ntask as a node.\nHiring request is a node\ncreate jd\nApprove Jd\n..\n\n\nall these are node, we draw edge in between them, with the help of these edges, and in these edge we can appy looping\nbranching etc that make code more maintainable, this control executes. these\nedges decide control flow. Since we are representing whole workflow as a graph, and graph is a non linear \ndata structure. Here we can represent any workflow no matter howmuch complex.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MI22b_ET6ao8aTuoPKtpe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1305.2079659127426,
      "y": 104029.32020722446,
      "width": 539,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bvl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 305761135,
      "version": 718,
      "versionNonce": 1379410994,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "HPotCKwhp6s-MIrXcIaGL",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1781398945275,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "graph.add_node(\"HiringRequest\", hiring_request)\ngraph.add_node(\"CreateJD\", create_jd)\ngraph.add_node(\"CheckApproval\", check_approval)\ngraph.add_node(\"PostJD\", post_jd)\n\n\n\ngraph.add_edge(\"HiringRequest\", \"CreateJD\")\ngraph.add_edge(\"CreateJD\", \"CheckApproval\")\n\ngraph.add_conditional_edges(\n    \"CheckApproval\",\n    approval_router{\n        \"approved\": \"PostJD\",\n        \"not_approved\": \"CreateJD\"\n    }\n    )\n\ngraph.add_edge(\"PostJD\", END)\n\n\nNo glue code here, we are not writing anything\nin raw file, LangGraph itself giving feature\nfor conditional workflow.\nwe can do looping, ifelse, jumping etc everything\nin LangGraph\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "graph.add_node(\"HiringRequest\", hiring_request)\ngraph.add_node(\"CreateJD\", create_jd)\ngraph.add_node(\"CheckApproval\", check_approval)\ngraph.add_node(\"PostJD\", post_jd)\n\n\n\ngraph.add_edge(\"HiringRequest\", \"CreateJD\")\ngraph.add_edge(\"CreateJD\", \"CheckApproval\")\n\ngraph.add_conditional_edges(\n    \"CheckApproval\",\n    approval_router{\n        \"approved\": \"PostJD\",\n        \"not_approved\": \"CreateJD\"\n    }\n    )\n\ngraph.add_edge(\"PostJD\", END)\n\n\nNo glue code here, we are not writing anything\nin raw file, LangGraph itself giving feature\nfor conditional workflow.\nwe can do looping, ifelse, jumping etc everything\nin LangGraph\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
