    {
      "id": "BGBv0YZLua7NYqKBp-h7a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1295.7729024845225,
      "y": 107322.47448476142,
      "width": 1067,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bwf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 338899822,
      "version": 649,
      "versionNonce": 2089684210,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781399862274,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. LLM is also a series of task but many of them dependent on LLM\n2. LLM workflows are a step by step process using which we can build complex LLM applications\n3. Each step in a workflow perform a distinct task - such as prompting, reasoning, tool calling, \n    memory access or decision making\n3. Workflows can be linear, parallel branched or looped, allowing for complex behaviours like\n    retries , multiagent communication or tool augmented reasoning.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. LLM is also a series of task but many of them dependent on LLM\n2. LLM workflows are a step by step process using which we can build complex LLM applications\n3. Each step in a workflow perform a distinct task - such as prompting, reasoning, tool calling, \n    memory access or decision making\n3. Workflows can be linear, parallel branched or looped, allowing for complex behaviours like\n    retries , multiagent communication or tool augmented reasoning.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
