    {
      "id": "6ItuT4eFTO-ltJd146rsY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1412.2100930785887,
      "y": 110538.38568525595,
      "width": 1078,
      "height": 825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "byw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1126715310,
      "version": 1577,
      "versionNonce": 473865198,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781402198861,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The system generates an essay topic, collects the student submission and evaluates it in parallel\non depth of analysis, language quality and the clarity of thought. Based on the combined score, it\neither gives feedback for improvements or approve the essay.\n\n1. GenerateTopic\n   - System generates a releavant UPSC-style essay topic and present it to the student\n\n2 CollectEssay\n    - Student writes and submits the essay based on the generated topic\n\n3 EvaluateEssay(Parallel evaluation block)\n    - Three Evaluation tasks run in parallel\n    1. EvaluateDepth -> Analyzes depth of analysis, argument stregth and critical thinking.\n    2. EvaluateLanguage -> Checks Grammar,Vocabulary, Fluency and tone.\n    3. EvaluateClarity -> Assesses coherence, logical flow and clarity of thought\n\n4 Aggregate Results ->\n    Combines the 3 score and generates a total score(e.g out of 15)\n\n5 ConditionalRouting ->\n    Based on the total score\n    If score meets threshold -> go to ShowSuccess\n    If score is below threshold -> go to GiveFeedback\n\n6 GiveFeedback ->\n    Provide targeted suggestions for improvement in weak areas\n\n7 CollectRevision(Optional Loop) -> \n    Student resubmit the revised essay\n    Loop back to evaluate essay\n\n8 ShowSuccess ->\n    Congratulates the student and ends the flow.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The system generates an essay topic, collects the student submission and evaluates it in parallel\non depth of analysis, language quality and the clarity of thought. Based on the combined score, it\neither gives feedback for improvements or approve the essay.\n\n1. GenerateTopic\n   - System generates a releavant UPSC-style essay topic and present it to the student\n\n2 CollectEssay\n    - Student writes and submits the essay based on the generated topic\n\n3 EvaluateEssay(Parallel evaluation block)\n    - Three Evaluation tasks run in parallel\n    1. EvaluateDepth -> Analyzes depth of analysis, argument stregth and critical thinking.\n    2. EvaluateLanguage -> Checks Grammar,Vocabulary, Fluency and tone.\n    3. EvaluateClarity -> Assesses coherence, logical flow and clarity of thought\n\n4 Aggregate Results ->\n    Combines the 3 score and generates a total score(e.g out of 15)\n\n5 ConditionalRouting ->\n    Based on the total score\n    If score meets threshold -> go to ShowSuccess\n    If score is below threshold -> go to GiveFeedback\n\n6 GiveFeedback ->\n    Provide targeted suggestions for improvement in weak areas\n\n7 CollectRevision(Optional Loop) -> \n    Student resubmit the revised essay\n    Loop back to evaluate essay\n\n8 ShowSuccess ->\n    Congratulates the student and ends the flow.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
