    {
      "id": "GKXZKAgmebYrhkWAhpzOp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1403.6991020240375,
      "y": 112653.16303130187,
      "width": 1221,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bzk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1601272626,
      "version": 687,
      "versionNonce": 1968360814,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781404809628,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In this graph we have two things \nNodes\nEdges\n\nEach node represent a single task in our workflow, LangGraph does exactly same thing when it creates\na graph, node represent a single task, In LangGraph each node behind the scene is a Python function, Essentialy\nin LangGraph graph is a set of Python functions which are interconnected with the help of edges, edge tell us\nafter execution of one node, what will be next node.\nNode tell us what to do\nEdge tell us next what we need to do.\n\nEdges can be of diff-diff types\nSequential edges(one by one)\nparallel edges\nCondition edges",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In this graph we have two things \nNodes\nEdges\n\nEach node represent a single task in our workflow, LangGraph does exactly same thing when it creates\na graph, node represent a single task, In LangGraph each node behind the scene is a Python function, Essentialy\nin LangGraph graph is a set of Python functions which are interconnected with the help of edges, edge tell us\nafter execution of one node, what will be next node.\nNode tell us what to do\nEdge tell us next what we need to do.\n\nEdges can be of diff-diff types\nSequential edges(one by one)\nparallel edges\nCondition edges",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AijytoDZHmGx8SxrzNSz_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1371.6039722591754,
      "y": 113099.28724557375,
      "width": 88,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
